{"id":"vod_sn_36406","vodId":"36406","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"下级生第一季","name_cn":"下级生第一季","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/62459de5eaab6eb2364a42d980a822f8.jpg"},"summary":"本作品描述主角健太郎（けんたろう）与结城瑞穂为首的女主角们之间的恋爱故事，酌取和《同级生》相同类型的基本剧情与地图移动式冒险的系统，游戏内时间设定为1年，尝试描写出关系慢慢加深的爱情之作品。然而该尝试在玩家立场来看，无法否定游戏时间的漫长造成出疲惫感之破绽。此外，不用攻略本来玩的话难度相当高，这点也是个负面评价。与《同级生》最大的差异点在于，依照持有金额的多寡，能够比对谈或约会所持金次第更容易提升女主角的好感度。但是也可能造成因此无法拜见事件，并不方便使用。附带一提，标题虽然为《下级生》，不过登场人物中的下级生并不多。这点与《同级生》里只有少数同级生一样，推测是反应出制作当时游戏的风气。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uk2VcdAbzB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PHMnudjNQ81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gpp0Suse9e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZG0mjsj5Pd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RsNDDcAJsK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Qan72tkXsa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BtyKDVBV6W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DPrD9cSgUL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9TcWLY8cP31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UTLpe3i5xf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E1LaFq6QWd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0MSnmQ7S2E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZFFV1BtHAs1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:23.619Z"}